Output docs/assets/cli-init.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set WindowBarSize 40
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 20

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "rail init my-service" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Down
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
